msgid "# Dependency Version Management"
msgstr "# 依赖版本管理"

msgid ""
"This page lists the pinned dependency stack of vLLM Ascend that changes most\n"
"often: which files to update when a version changes, and where each component\n"
"is installed from. The versions shown are example values of one known-good\n"
"stack."
msgstr ""
"本页列出了 vLLM Ascend "
"中最常变动的固定依赖栈：版本变更时需要更新哪些文件，以及每个组件从何处安装。表中显示的版本是某一组已知可用依赖栈的示例值。"

msgid "## Pinned dependency stack"
msgstr "## 固定依赖栈"

msgid "| Component | Example version | Files to update | Installed from |"
msgstr "| 组件 | 示例版本 | 需更新的文件 | 安装来源 |"

