"| torch | 2.10.0 | `requirements.txt`<br>`pyproject.toml` `[build-system]` |"
" PyTorch CPU index <https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu/> (images), PyPI "
"<https://pypi.org/simple/> (CI) |"
msgstr ""
"| torch | 2.10.0 | `requirements.txt`<br>`pyproject.toml` `[build-system]` |"
" PyTorch CPU index <https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu/>（镜像），PyPI "
