msgid "By default, update all files listed for a component."
msgstr "默认情况下，更新某个组件列出的所有文件。"

msgid "## Example: changing a version"
msgstr "## 示例：变更版本"

msgid ""
"Every version pin each file contains, so a version change is one pass per\n"
"file. The `-` lines use the example versions from the table; replace\n"
"`<new-version>` with the target version."
msgstr ""
"以下列出每个文件包含的所有版本固定项，因此版本变更时每个文件只需处理一遍。`-` 行使用表中的示例版本；请将 `<new-version>` "
"替换为目标版本。"

